# Database Design

## 1. Introduction

The database is an important part of the Virtual Customer Support System. It stores and manages information related to students, tickets, support staff, knowledge-base articles, and feedback.

A well-organized database helps the system provide reliable and efficient support.

## 2. Purpose

The main purposes of database management are:

* Store support information
* Organize student details
* Store ticket records
* Maintain knowledge-base information
* Store feedback
* Retrieve information quickly
* Protect important data

## 3. Main Entities

The proposed system contains the following main entities:

1. Student
2. Ticket
3. Support Staff
4. Knowledge Base
5. Feedback

## 4. Student Table

The Student table stores basic information about students.

| Field      | Description        |
| ---------- | ------------------ |
| Student_ID | Unique student ID  |
| Name       | Student name       |
| Email      | Student email      |
| Department | Student department |
| Password   | Login information  |

## 5. Ticket Table

The Ticket table stores student support requests.

| Field         | Description                    |
| ------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Ticket_ID     | Unique ticket ID               |
| Student_ID    | Student who created the ticket |
| Problem_Title | Title of the problem           |
| Description   | Problem details                |
| Category      | Problem category               |
| Priority      | Ticket priority                |
| Status        | Current ticket status          |
| Staff_ID      | Assigned support staff         |
| Created_Date  | Ticket creation date           |

## 6. Support Staff Table

This table stores information about support staff.

| Field      | Description      |
| ---------- | ---------------- |
| Staff_ID   | Unique staff ID  |
| Name       | Staff name       |
| Email      | Staff email      |
| Department | Staff department |
| Expertise  | Technical area   |

## 7. Knowledge Base Table

This table stores troubleshooting information.

| Field        | Description                       |
| ------------ | --------------------------------- |
| Article_ID   | Unique article ID                 |
| Title        | Article title                     |
| Category     | Article category                  |
| Description  | Problem description               |
| Solution     | Solution or troubleshooting steps |
| Updated_Date | Last update date                  |

## 8. Feedback Table

This table stores student feedback.

| Field       | Description                |
| ----------- | -------------------------- |
| Feedback_ID | Unique feedback ID         |
| Ticket_ID   | Related ticket             |
| Student_ID  | Student providing feedback |
| Rating      | Rating from 1 to 5         |
| Comment     | Student comments           |
| Date        | Feedback date              |

